    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDelightful two-bedroom ground floor apartment located in Carrigweir close to Tuam town centre. Enjoying an excellent location within the highly sought-after Carrigweir development this well-presented apartment is deceptively spacious with a bright newly decorated airy interior. \nEntering through a private door the ground floor entrance hall brings you to the front of the apartment with an open plan kitchen dining and living area with two large windows facing out onto a courtyard area. To the rear of the apartment are two good sized double bedrooms (one with ensuite) both with built in wardrobes. A bright bathroom with floor to ceiling tiling and bath completes the accommodation. The apartment is being sold fully furnished, making this a turn key property to occupy or rent out immediately.\nThe Carrigweir apartments are an intimate community that commands a highly coveted central location. Ample parking and well maintained communal landscaped garden areas add to the appeal of this fine development. With all the amenities Tuam has to offer right on your doorstep this property is sure to attract a wide audience from first time buyers, those looking to downsize and investors alike. BER C1\nViewing is a must. Please call Sherry FitzGerald office on 09326622"
      },
